#4471 merged 412 reports about wrong dates into one ticket and marked it known. Read by tenant
(locale and booking form), they are three different problems.

| Problem | Reports |
|---|---|
| `parser`: dates read month first for day-first tenants | 374 |
| `hint`: booking-v3 prints `MM/DD/YYYY` under the date field | 33 |
| one-day move: off by one day, not a month flip | 5 |

<Callout>
The parser fix covers the first row only. The `hint` problem was closed as won't fix because
"booking-v3 form retired", but alder.physio, copper.studio and pale.harbour still run booking-v3.
</Callout>

